							<string name="Name">Instruction Manual </string>
							<string name="Source">This is a oneway teleporter.
This is great For games where you choose your class And fight.
If you want a normal oneway teleporter delete the PUT THIS IN TOOL script.
If you want the teleporter to Not say anything above it delete the humanoid.
If you want a teleporter that also is a giver, follow the instructions below.
Step One: Get a tool you want the person who teleports to get.
Step Two: Put the PUT THIS IN TOOl script In the tool you got.
Step Three: Put the tool In the Head brick.
Optional Step: If you want more than one tool to be given copy the PUT THIS IN TOOL script as needed 
And Repeat steps One through Three.
I hope this will help you make a cool game.
If you want a non talking one Then you can rename the Head brick otherwise leave it as it is Or it wont work.
Please dont forget to give credit. =D</string>
